      "side": 1,
      "message": "I had seen this and investigated, but sorry that I missed putting a comment. objtool complains on lretq because it didn\u0027t expect a far return from a callable function. objecttool expects this only in kernel entry/exit functions(syscall, intr nmi etc) and expects this only in assembly code (SYM_CODE_START/SYM_CODE_END). I had tried moving the last part of code to a asm file, but didn\u0027t help. We should probably upstream a change to objtool to ignore this usecase as well once we have a upstreamable version of this.\n\nI have put a small comment here now.",
      "parentUuid": "634c00ea_5afad339",
